hol in the Republic of Korea; and a collaboration agreement with OnKai for its AI platform and Tissue Dynamics to develop a novel human chronic cardiac fibrosis model. Galmed Pharmaceuticals Ltd. was founded in 2000 and is headquartered in Ramat Gan, Israel."}}